        "index": 69,
        "selectable_text": "10 . The system according to claim 9, wherein the monitoring engine is configured to update the at least one hash table (TH) saved following the step of saving the at least one digital session fingerprint (HS), by assigning the save status (SV) to the at least one digital session fingerprint (HS) based on activation of the at least one trigger.",
